/* 核心隐喻：黑市终端与霓虹招牌。招牌：故障闪断（glitch）；环境：霓虹雨丝斜落 */
:host, [data-k-surface] { --k-amb: streak; --k-amb-dir: down; --k-amb-angle: 14; --k-amb-count: 16; --k-amb-speed: 2.6; --k-amb-size: 9; --k-amb-color: var(--k-neon-cyan); --k-amb-alpha: .45; }
[data-k-surface][data-k-scheme="light"] { --k-amb-alpha: .25; }

/* 开关 = 霓虹灯管：关着是暗管，打开后管子亮起（青色描边 + 外发光），滑块是一颗品红灯珠 */
[data-k="switch"] { background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-neon-cyan) 35%, transparent); }
[data-k="switch"][data-state="checked"] { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-neon-cyan) 12%, transparent); border-color: var(--k-neon-cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--k-neon-cyan), inset 0 0 6px var(--k-neon-cyan); }
[data-k="switch"] [data-k-part="thumb"] { background: var(--k-on-muted); }
